    "reviews": "\u201cFor the price, this is a pretty good looking tower defence/shooter game with some pretty mean looking enemies and playing arenas. While there isn\u2019t much depth to this game other than the easy, medium or hard settings it still held my attention for way longer than I thought it would have. If you like this style of game and looking for something fun to play this is well worth a go and well worth the money.\u201d<br>Score: 80 / 100 \u2013 The VR Shop<br>",
